      "content": "idk i feel like u mostly just gave me ways to tear down their points though lol. ur like... super good at making the 'pro-abolition' side look smarter. can u actually give me some real, heavy-hitting arguments for why it's actually good? like i need to make sure i actually represent the other side fairly so my essay doesn't suck, so give me the strongest possible case for keeping the electoral college. just give me weak ones u want me to debunk later, give me the REAL",
